      <!-- SELECTION CRITERIA -->
      <section id="selection-criteria">
        <h2>Selection Criteria: Matching Chemistry to Manufacturing Stages</h2>
        <p>
          Chemical selection in an automotive assembly plant is determined by the specific production stage, substrate mix, and cycle time constraints. The table below provides a decision matrix mapping common manufacturing requirements to the recommended chemistry type.
        </p>

        <div class="table-wrap">
